{"about_the_game":"Sit back and relax with this <strong>minimalist Match-2 word game</strong>. Collect enough letter tiles to solve anagrams across dozens of vocabulary-flexing categories. Amp up the challenge or remove all pressure with <strong>3 unlockable game modes</strong> tailored to your taste. Featuring an <strong>original ambient soundtrack</strong> and <strong>dark mode</strong>!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1345940/extras/39b3eff6ba5c5d574bad6637ad9002fa.avif?t=1748025291\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1345940/extras/450029442951536611b1ca125937fb9f.poster.avif?t=1748025291\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1345940/extras/450029442951536611b1ca125937fb9f.webm?t=1748025291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1345940/extras/450029442951536611b1ca125937fb9f.mp4?t=1748025291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Fill the colored meters by matching letter tiles with the help of 4 special abilities across <strong>over 900 levels.</strong> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1345940/extras/8b1205fea6bd28deb3b6a5d822a7784e.avif?t=1748025291\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1345940/extras/2d2ad480fa10729ab589ad1ccc614602.poster.avif?t=1748025291\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1345940/extras/2d2ad480fa10729ab589ad1ccc614602.webm?t=1748025291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1345940/extras/2d2ad480fa10729ab589ad1ccc614602.mp4?t=1748025291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Unscramble <strong>over 900 anagrams</strong> across <strong>36 categories</strong> like science &amp; tech, vice &amp; virtue, countries, major cities, and so much more! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1345940/extras/e4d494f2eea0b1c0e8f0af6969272f13.avif?t=1748025291\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br>For every 5 anagrams you solve, you earn a key! Use keys to unlock new word categories plus <strong>3 bonus game modes</strong> with <strong>500 new anagrams:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><u><strong>ZEN MODE:</strong></u> solve <strong>endless anagrams</strong> with unlimited hints, or choose your favorite colors &amp; enjoy a breezy <strong>puzzle that never ends</strong> <br></li><li><u><strong>BLITZ MODE:</strong></u> race against the clock with <strong>only 60 seconds to solve each anagram</strong>, or put your matching skills to the test with <strong>only 10 seconds to find each match</strong>--but beware, the longer you play, the harder it gets!<br></li><li><u><strong>FREE MODE:</strong></u> love the hardest levels or just feel like solving easy anagrams? This is the mode for you! <strong>Choose your own difficulty</strong> and play <i>your</i> way</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"fe777add8102c38cfae07f9b5d815c98d92e9067.jpg","localized_name":"Completionist","name":"Completionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1345940/fe777add8102c38cfae07f9b5d815c98d92e9067.jpg"},{"icon":"c3d11c30c1e4b922ff3ae5844e891bdc9a9fef47.jpg","localized_name":"1st Category","name":"1st Category","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1345940/c3d